  "title": "RTPS: Fix filter name rtps.flag.undisposed to rtps.flag.disposed",
  "description": "The PID_STATUS_INFO \"Disposed\" flag had a misleading filter name\n\"rtps.flag.undisposed\" that contradicted its display name and\nsemantics. Rename to \"rtps.flag.disposed\".\n\nNote: this is a breaking change for existing display filters,\ncolorfilters, or tshark scripts that reference rtps.flag.undisposed.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
